WEBVTT

00:12:54.746 --> 00:13:01.871
eyes. But what is happening is there is
a model that is ingesting lots of text

00:13:02.329 --> 00:13:05.829
and it is trying to predict the next word.

00:13:07.621 --> 00:13:10.954
So we use Transformer's they
take in a context,

00:13:10.954 --> 00:13:13.121
which is a particular architecture
of an A.I. model,

00:13:13.537 --> 00:13:15.537
they take in a context of a lot of words,

00:13:15.537 --> 00:13:17.329
let's say like a thousand
or something like that.

00:13:17.621 --> 00:13:20.787
And they try to predict the word that
comes next in the sequence.

00:13:22.162 --> 00:13:23.829
And there's like a lot of other
things that happen,

00:13:23.829 --> 00:13:25.329
but fundamentally that's it,

00:13:25.787 --> 00:13:28.496
and I think this is interesting
because in

00:13:28.496 --> 00:13:31.996
the process of playing that little game
of trying to predict the next word,